OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum votes show people want
OL,4,Ahelp, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Conservative leader says
OL,7,Freferendums on whether asylum seekers
OL,8,Fshould be housed in military camps are
OL,9,F"a good way of showing the strength of
OL,10,Fpublic feeling".
OL,12,FKemi Badenoch supported calls for
OL,13,Freferendums on housing these migrants
OL,14,Fin Suffolk, including at RAF Barnham,
OL,15,Fand said they showed people were
OL,16,F"asking for help".
OL,18,FWhen questioned about a lack of
OL,19,Fevidence indicating that asylum seekers
OL,20,Fwere responsible for increased crime,
OL,21,Fshe responded: "This is what is said
OL,22,Funtil something bad happens."
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
