OL,3,GNEWSAAsylum votes show people want
OL,4,Ahelp, says Badenoch
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government said accommodation at
OL,7,Fmilitary bases was "temporary" while
OL,8,Fasylum seekers' claims were processed,
OL,9,Fand a cheaper alternative to hotels.
